[list]
[*]With Floors Are (Absolutely) Worthless active, floor borders are worth nothing too, as the floors they edge are. They add nothing to your colony's wealth, which raids are sized from, and nothing to a room's wealth. Borders you have already built are worth nothing as well. Their beauty is unchanged.
[*]Without that mod nothing changes: borders are still valued by their material and the work to build them.
[*]For mod authors: a border your mod adds can do the same with one MarketValue entry in its statBases, which the game skips whenever Floors Are (Absolutely) Worthless is not active. The README on GitHub has the line.
[*]Unchanged: Neat Edges still requires only Harmony, no defs were added or renamed, and nothing new is saved.
[/list]
